<h2>Shop by Room</h2>
<h3>Drawing Room Sofa Chairs</h3>
<p>The drawing room in a Pakistani home is where guests sit and the furniture is on full view. A sofa chair design for this space needs to look good, hold its shape over time, and suit a formal setting. Our drawing room options include high-back wingback chairs, rich button-tufted velvet pieces, and structured silhouettes with solid wood frames. The Button Tufted Wingback Accent Chair and the Corduroy Wide Armchair with Bolster Pillows are two of the most popular choices in this category. Both are luxury high back sofa chair designs that fit well in formal Pakistani drawing rooms without looking out of place.</p>
<h3>Bedroom Chairs</h3>
<p>A sofa chair for bedroom gives a bedroom somewhere to sit that is not the bed. Whether it goes beside the window, near the wardrobe, or in a corner, a bedroom sofa chair adds function and a finished look to the room. Our bedroom chair options range from compact armless tufted velvet designs for tighter spaces to plush lambswool-style side chairs for larger rooms. If you are specifically searching for sofa chairs for bedroom that are comfortable for daily use and look genuinely good, this range covers both requirements.</p>
<h3>Living Room and Lounge Chairs</h3>
