<h3>Traditional Crafted</h3>
<h3>Classic Wingback and Button-Tufted</h3>
<p>The wingback shape is one of the most searched sofa chair design categories in Pakistan. Our button-tufted wingback chairs feature deep button detailing across the back and seat, premium velvet upholstery, and solid hardwood frames. These chairs are built for formal drawing rooms and lounges where a luxury chair is expected to look the part. Available in every velvet colour, made to your confirmed specifications.</p>
<h3>Mid-Century Modern</h3>
<p>Clean lines, solid wood tapered legs, and well-proportioned cushioning are the core features of our mid-century range. These modern chair designs draw from 1950s and 1960s furniture traditions and are built entirely at our Lahore workshop. The Spindle Accent Chair has handcrafted bobbin-turned arms that connect directly to Pakistani woodworking craft. The Corduroy Wide Armchair adds texture and depth to a room chair design with its ribbed fabric and wide seat.</p>
<h3>Scandinavian Boucle and Modern Minimal</h3>
<p>Boucle is now one of the most requested fabric options among Pakistani interior designers and homeowners. The textured looped surface adds visual interest without a bold colour, stays cooler than velvet through Pakistani summers, and holds up well in dusty environments. Our boucle sofa chair for bedroom options include the Bohemian Boucle Accent Chair and the Modern Boucle Wingback Armchair, both among our most ordered designs. These relaxing sofa chair designs use natural wood legs and neutral fabric tones that work with a wide range of Pakistani home colour schemes.</p>
<h3>Bold Velvet Statement Chairs</h3>
<p>For those who want their chair style to be the most visible thing in the room, our velvet statement chairs are the right choice. The Mustard Yellow Velvet Accent Chair with Metal Legs, the Soft Velvet Upholstered Accent Chair, and the Armless Tufted Velvet Chair are all high-visibility designs. Rich colour, plush fabric, finished with either gold-tone metal legs or solid wood. These are available in every velvet colour from emerald to dusty rose, cobalt to ivory, and each is built only when ordered.</p>
<h2>Sofa Chair Price in Pakistan</h2>
<p>The most frequent question from customers is about sofa chair price in pakistan. At ComfyClub, pricing is based on design complexity, fabric selection, and dimensions. Our single sofa price in pakistan range reflects the real cost of handcrafted quality: solid wood frames, high-density foam, and premium fabric. Each price covers the complete chair including upholstery, frame, and cushioning.</p>
