<h3>What is the sofa chair price in Pakistan at ComfyClub?</h3>
<p>Prices vary by design, fabric, and dimensions. The sofa chair price in pakistan for each design is confirmed at the time of inquiry. Contact us on WhatsApp with the design name for an exact quote. All prices are in PKR and include the full chair.</p>
<h3>How long does delivery take after placing an order?</h3>
<p>Standard sofa chairs are delivered in 20 to 25 working days from the date advance payment is confirmed. Customized designs with non-standard dimensions or special fabrics may take 25 to 30 working days. We deliver to all major cities in Pakistan.</p>
<h3>Can I choose my own fabric and colour?</h3>
<p>Yes. Every single sofa is made to your confirmed fabric and colour. We offer velvet, boucle, linen, corduroy, flannel, and additional options on request. Confirm your choice with our team before the order is placed.</p>
<h3>Do you have compact bedroom chair designs for smaller rooms?</h3>
<p>Yes. The Armless Tufted Velvet Accent Chair and the Holiway Flannel Chair with Metal Legs are both compact bedroom chair designs that work in smaller rooms, studio apartments, and tight bedroom corners. Share your room dimensions with us and we will confirm the best fit.</p>
<h3>Is the sofa chair suitable for a home office?</h3>
<p>Some designs work well as a sofa chair for office or home office accent seat. The George Oliver Accent Chair with Metal Legs and the Dukinfield Upholstered Side Chair both provide structured support and a clean aesthetic. These are lounge chair and accent designs, not ergonomic task chairs, but they are a solid choice for home office reading or meeting corners.</p>
<h3>What is the difference between a single sofa and a sofa chair?</h3>
<p>In Pakistani furniture terminology, single sofa and sofa chair refer to the same product type: a one-seater upholstered chair with arms and a padded seat. ComfyClub uses both terms to describe this category.</p>
<h2>Ready to Order Your Chair?</h2>
<p>Browse the collection above, pick your design, and contact us on WhatsApp to confirm fabric, colour, and price. Our team in Lahore handles the rest.</p>' WHERE slug = '/sofas/sofa-chair/';
