<h2>How to Choose the Right Two Seater Sofa</h2>
<p>Picking the right sofa 2 seater requires more than choosing a shape from a photo. These five points will help you choose correctly for your space:</p>
<ul><li><strong>Room Size and Sofa Scale</strong></li></ul>
<p>Measure your room before selecting a design. A two seater sofa typically ranges from 140 cm to 180 cm in width. In a smaller bedroom or compact lounge, a small 2 seater sofa at 140 to 150 cm is the right fit. In a drawing room or open lounge, a wider 160 to 180 cm design gives the sofa the visual weight it needs to hold the space.</p>
<ul><li><strong>Fabric for Your Lifestyle</strong></li></ul>
<p>Velvet is the richest option visually but retains heat in Pakistani summers. Boucle and linen breathe better and suit year-round use. Fabric and chenille are the most practical for high-traffic rooms used by children and daily family life. Corduroy hides wear and marks better than any other fabric. Choose based on who will use the sofa and how often.</p>
