<p>A classic button-tufted or wingback two seater sofa fits formal drawing rooms and traditional interiors. A modern 2 seater sofa with tapered legs fits contemporary apartments and open-plan spaces. A boucle or fabric sofa in neutral tones is the most versatile option and fits almost any existing colour palette.</p>
