<p>A 2 seater sofa for bedroom use does not need the same depth as a lounge sofa. For sitting and reading, a firmer, shallower seat is more practical. For lounging and relaxing in a TV room, a deeper, softer seat is the right choice. All our sofas use high-density foam that holds its shape over years, not the cheap sponge that collapses within months.</p>
